[[File:Ot007 o en.png]]
:''Production Speed of Cats increased!''
The '''Relativity Clock''' is the third [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]. It decreases the recharge times of all [[Cat Units]].

==Effect==
Each Relativity Clock decreases recharge times by a maximum of 1 second.

When a player has activated Relativity Clock at 100% in all three chapters, recharge times are decreased by 3 seconds.

<sup>Cannot reduce Cat Production time below 2.0 seconds</sup>

