*In the Japanese version, the Relativity Clock's equivalent is the '''Tradition of Chūgoku''' (中国の伝統), Chūgoku being a region of the Japanese island of Honshu.
**In the [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English version]], its name was shortened to just '''Tradition'''.
